,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025670,["nextId"]={1025671}
,["content"]="但你似乎不願意接受這種形式。為什麼呢？那樣不是挺好的嗎？",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025671]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7022001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025671,["key"]=1025671,["nextId"]={1025672}
,["talk"]="洛基",["talkRoleID"]={7022001}
,["talk_en"]="Loki",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="……",["header_center"]=4}
,[1025672]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7026001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025672,["nextId"]={1025673}
,["talk"]="托爾",["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["key"]=1025672,["content"]="老實承認吧，『人類』這種生物就是喜歡抓著對自己有利的想法不放，只相信自己可以接受的那一套。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025673]={["talk"]="托爾",["key"]=1025673,["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025673,["nextId"]={1025674}
,["content"]="所以歸根結底，這全都是你們的錯。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025674]={["talk"]="托爾",["key"]=1025674,["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025674,["nextId"]={1025675}
,["content"]="要是你們真的有心改變這個板塊，就該狠下心把我從統治者的位置拉下來，但你們卻選擇了默不作聲。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025675]={["talk"]="托爾",["key"]=1025675,["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025675,["nextId"]={1025676}
,["content"]="沒人願意背負責任，只想著隨便找個人替罪，然後擺出事不關己的態度。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025676]={["talk"]="托爾",["key"]=1025676,["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025676,["nextId"]={1025677}
,["content"]="這樣的你們就算被我戲耍，也沒什麼好抱怨的吧。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025677]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7022001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025677,["key"]=1025677,["nextId"]={1025678}
,["talk"]="洛基",["talkRoleID"]={7022001}
,["talk_en"]="Loki",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="所以你現在想來報復嗎？",["header_center"]=4}
,[1025678]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7026001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025678,["nextId"]={1025679}
,["talk"]="托爾",["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["key"]=1025678,["content"]="要報復的話，過去有的是機會，我剛才的一番話只是想讓你認識到自己的愚蠢。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025679]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7022001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025679,["key"]=1025679,["showStory"]=2,["talk"]="洛基",["talkRoleID"]={7022001}
,["talk_en"]="Loki",["options"]={1021501}
,["content"]="說話拐彎抹角的傢伙……",["header_center"]=4}
,[1025680]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7026001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1025680,["nextId"]={1025681}
,["talk"]="托爾",["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["key"]=1025680,["content"]="之前那次閒聊你還記得啊，我還以為你會是個更不拘小節的人呢。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1025681]={["talk"]="托爾",["key"]=1025681,["talkRoleID"]={7026001}
,["talk_en"]="Thor",["id"]=1025681,["nextId"]={1025682}
,["content"]="這也怪我在你面前放鬆了警惕，不小心說了多餘的話。",["showStory"]=2}
