,["talk"]="卡提那",["talkRoleID"]={6009001}
,["talk_en"]="Courtain",["key"]=2011428,["content"]="如此奮不顧身的戰鬥也僅僅是解除了這片雷雲嗎……",["showStory"]=2}
,[2011429]={["talk"]="？？？",["nextId"]={2011430}
