,["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="也許真相並非你說的那樣。",["header_center"]=6}
,[1021698]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7024003,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021698,["key"]=1021698,["nextId"]={1021699}
,["talk"]="絲卡蒂",["talkRoleID"]={7024003}
,["talk_en"]="Skadi",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="什麼意思？",["header_center"]=6}
,[1021699]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=9906001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021699,["nextId"]={1021700}
,["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["key"]=1021699,["content"]="一般情況下，有定律管制住的造物是不會襲擊人類的。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021700]={["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["key"]=1021700,["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["id"]=1021700,["nextId"]={1021701}
,["content"]="哪怕有萬分之一的幾率，它們真的突破了定律的桎梏，也不可能馬上形成集體性。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021701]={["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["key"]=1021701,["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["id"]=1021701,["nextId"]={1021702}
,["content"]="而且誰規定了造物失控就一定會屠戮人類？",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021702]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7024003,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021702,["nextId"]={1021703}
,["talk"]="絲卡蒂",["talkRoleID"]={7024003}
,["talk_en"]="Skadi",["key"]=1021702,["content"]="你究竟想說什麼？",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021703]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=9906001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021703,["nextId"]={1021704}
,["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["key"]=1021703,["content"]="我的意思已經很明顯了吧，它們並非失控或是覺醒，而是被操控了。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021704]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7024003,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021704,["key"]=1021704,["nextId"]={1021705}
,["talk"]="絲卡蒂",["talkRoleID"]={7024003}
,["talk_en"]="Skadi",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="操控……？",["header_center"]=6}
,[1021705]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=9906001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021705,["nextId"]={1021706}
,["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["key"]=1021705,["content"]="雖然被控制的物件不一樣，但在我和總隊長去的上一個板塊，就遇到過被異變奪取意識的碎星人。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021706]={["talk"]="普羅米修斯",["key"]=1021706,["talkRoleID"]={9906001}
,["talk_en"]="Prometheus",["id"]=1021706,["nextId"]={1021707}
,["content"]="只不過這個板塊受害的是那個世界樹。",["showStory"]=2}
,[1021707]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=7024003,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
}
,["id"]=1021707,["key"]=1021707,["nextId"]={1021708}
,["talk"]="絲卡蒂",["talkRoleID"]={7024003}
,["talk_en"]="Skadi",["showStory"]=2,["content"]="我造出來的世界樹成為了被人利用的兵器？",["header_center"]=4}
,[1021708]={["roleInfos"]={{["id"]=9906001,["enter"]=2,["pos"]=2}
